msgid "显式时钟借用与睡眠边界"
msgstr "Explicit clock borrowing and sleep boundaries"

msgid "ClockDomain 提供 caller-owned 时钟借用与排空屏障；F407 的浅 Sleep 与深 STOP 通过不同的显式硬件入口使用屏障。组件不建立全局 PM 注册表、任务、定时器、最大 对象池或默认状态。未选的 `Nexus::ClockDomain` 和 SoC 电源目标保持按需选编。 Board 不自动选择唤醒接线。借用结束条件见 [请求生命周期图](../assets/diagrams/request-lifecycle.svg)，整平台协调见 [系统架构](../delivery/architecture.md)。图中的借用终止不是时钟域转换凭证。"
msgstr "ClockDomain provides caller-owned clock leases and a drain barrier. F407 shallow Sleep and deep STOP use that barrier through separate explicit hardware entries. The component creates no global PM registry, task, timer, maximum object pool or default state. Unselected `Nexus::ClockDomain` and SoC power targets remain optional. Boards do not automatically select wake wiring. Borrow termination is shown in the [request lifecycle diagram](../assets/diagrams/request-lifecycle.svg); whole-platform coordination is described in the [system architecture](../delivery/architecture.md). Borrow termination in that diagram is not a clock-domain conversion receipt."

msgid "公共 API 使用 opaque `nx_clock_domain_t`，mutable storage / constructor 只供私有 装配。消费者提供自然对齐、零初始化的 `nx_clock_lease_t`。接纳成功后，token 的对象 身份和存储被借用，字段由 provider 管理；复制字段不能释放原对象。每个 domain 的显式 capacity 为别名和 retained identity 扫描给出上限，不承诺与容量无关的常数时间。"
msgstr "The public API uses opaque `nx_clock_domain_t`; mutable storage / constructors are private assembly details. The consumer supplies a naturally aligned, zero-initialized `nx_clock_lease_t`. Successful admission borrows the token's identity and storage, with provider-managed fields; copying fields cannot release the original object. Each domain's explicit capacity bounds alias and retained-identity scans; no capacity-independent constant time is promised."

msgid "生命周期的唯一 privileged Thread owner 调用 `close`，禁止新增 lease，再自行推动 每个设备停止、DMA/IRQ/完成通知排空。消费者成功 detach 后才 release。close 本身 不取消设备，release 不证明外设已停止。现存 lease 不因超时、关闭或睡眠被撤回。 `quiescent` 仅在当前 closed epoch 且 count/list 同时为空时返回成功；reopen 只有在 排空后才能单调提升 admission epoch，最大值永久拒绝复用。旧控制值不能跨 epoch 重开或建立排空凭证。domain storage 的生命周期长于全部控制副本，禁止 memset 重置。"
msgstr "The sole privileged Thread lifecycle owner calls `close` to prevent new leases, then drives each device's stop and drains DMA/IRQ/completion notifications itself. Consumers release only after successful detach. Close does not cancel devices, and release does not prove a peripheral stopped. Timeout, close or sleep never revoke existing leases. `quiescent` succeeds only in the current closed epoch with both count and list empty. Reopen can monotonically advance the admission epoch only after drain; the maximum permanently rejects reuse. Old control values cannot reopen across epochs or establish drain proof. Domain storage outlives all control copies; resetting it with memset is prohibited."

msgid "metadata 保存恢复 incoming PRIMASK；Native 使用真实递归线程排他模型。acquire / release 可在 same-CPU privileged Thread、PendSV、SysTick 或外部 configurable IRQ 使用；构造、close、quiescent、reopen 为 serialized privileged Thread。NMI、fault、 SMP、signal 或其他安全域调用不在合同内。输出和 wake word 不能覆盖私有 provider、 retained token 或彼此；拒绝不能破坏已借用控制。没有回调或 token release 后的访问。"
msgstr "Metadata saves/restores incoming PRIMASK; Native uses a real recursive thread-exclusion model. Acquire / release may run in same-CPU privileged Thread, PendSV, SysTick or external configurable IRQ; construction, close, quiescent and reopen require serialized privileged Thread. NMI, fault, SMP, signals and other security domains are outside the contract. Outputs and wake words cannot overlap private provider state, retained tokens or each other; rejection cannot corrupt already borrowed controls. There are no callbacks or accesses after token release."

msgid "SoC sleep 在 incoming PRIMASK/BASEPRI/FAULTMASK 全清的 privileged Thread 调用。 同一个保存掩码下最终验证 closed barrier、所选静态 ClockPlan 的真实寄存器配置和 wake sequence，再 进入既有生产 `nx_arch_wait_for_interrupt`。WFI 保持 PRIMASK，已使能 IRQ 变为 pending 可以唤醒，恢复掩码后运行；返回后 owner 必须重检真实业务谓词。序列变化则成功返回 `slept=false`。浅 Sleep 入口拒绝已设置的 SCR.SLEEPDEEP、深 STOP 和动态 RUN；它不改写 SCR、 RCC、Flash、Tick、pending IRQ 或 deadline。32-bit wake sequence 需要调用者证明 观察窗口内不会完整绕回；不声称用一个快照解决 DMA/NMI/SMP 发布或无界 ABA。"
msgstr "SoC sleep requires privileged Thread context with incoming PRIMASK, BASEPRI and FAULTMASK all clear. Under the same saved mask it finally checks the closed barrier, the selected static ClockPlan's actual registers and the wake sequence before entering the existing production `nx_arch_wait_for_interrupt`. WFI retains PRIMASK; an enabled IRQ becoming pending can wake the CPU and runs after mask restoration. The owner must recheck its business predicate on return. A changed sequence returns success with `slept=false`. Shallow Sleep rejects an already set SCR.SLEEPDEEP, deep STOP and dynamic RUN. It does not rewrite SCR, RCC, Flash, Tick, pending IRQs or deadlines. The caller must prove that the 32-bit wake sequence cannot wrap completely within the observation window. One snapshot does not establish DMA/NMI/SMP publication or solve unbounded ABA."

msgid "F407 的默认 profile 为 HSE8／PLL168、APB1 42 MHz、APB2 84 MHz 与 Flash5WS。 静态 custom／直接输入使用同一 ClockPlan 的实际常量和只读 RCC 检查，不从默认 数字推导可用性；晶振频率、供电和温漂也不能由 ready/divisor 读回测得。"
msgstr "The default F407 profile uses HSE8/PLL168, APB1 42 MHz, APB2 84 MHz and Flash5WS. Static custom and direct-input profiles use actual constants from the same ClockPlan and read-only RCC checks, rather than deriving availability from default numbers. Ready/divider readbacks cannot measure oscillator frequency, supply voltage or temperature drift."

msgid "深 STOP 使用 `nx_stm32f407_power_enter`，调用者先完整暂停 Platform、排空自己的 ClockDomain 和 OS 时间借用，再显式提供已接纳的唤醒集合。恢复建立新的 Core epoch， 不能复用旧绝对 deadline；可选独立 RTC elapsed envelope 与 OS 时间恢复分别证明。 Standby 的复位、存储丢失及 RTC wake 握手由同一 RTC／电源 owner 协作承担。 完整前提、失败保留与已维护范围以 [F407 System 合同](f407-system-power.md)为准。 ClockDomain 自身不发现遗漏消费者，不暂停调度器、不计算跨 STOP 时间，也不替代 实际硬件关停与唤醒序列。当前不提供运行期 DVFS。"
msgstr "Deep STOP uses `nx_stm32f407_power_enter`. The caller first fully suspends Platform, drains its own ClockDomain and OS time borrowers, then supplies an explicitly admitted wake set. Restoration creates a new Core epoch; old absolute deadlines cannot be reused. An optional independent RTC elapsed envelope and OS time restoration require separate proof. The same RTC and power owners coordinate Standby reset, storage loss and RTC wake handshake. The [F407 System contract](f407-system-power.md) defines the complete prerequisites, retained failures and maintained scope. ClockDomain does not discover omitted consumers, pause a scheduler, calculate elapsed STOP time or replace actual hardware shutdown and wake sequencing. Runtime DVFS is currently unavailable."

msgid "当前测试直接执行生产 domain、Native 排他和 F4 sleep C 实现，只替换 CPU context／ WFI 外部叶子。历史跨系列 RED／GREEN 与测量记录保留原始身份，见 [固定旧源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md)。 本次软件结果须由当前门禁重新建立；主机模型不建立 physical HIL、WCET 或功耗资格。"
msgstr "Current tests execute production domain, Native exclusion and F4 sleep C directly, replacing only external CPU-context/WFI leaves. Historical cross-family RED/GREEN and measurement records retain their original identities at the [fixed prior source](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md). Current gates must establish this iteration's software results afresh; host models establish no physical HIL, WCET or power qualification."

msgid "资格边界"
msgstr "Qualification boundaries"

msgid "公共屏障、浅 Sleep、深 STOP 和所选自主唤醒分别取得证据；通用组件存在不能替代 精确 SoC 集成。旧 H743 pause/resume 不属于当前 F4 provider。主机模型只证明实际 执行的软件合同，ARM 链接只证明 ABI、所选闭包和静态预算。功耗、唤醒边沿、IRQ 延迟和物理保留仍需独立 HIL，当前为 `not_executed`。"
msgstr "The public barrier, shallow Sleep, deep STOP and selected autonomous wake require separate evidence. A generic component does not qualify exact SoC integration. The previous H743 pause/resume path is outside the current F4 provider. Host models establish executed software contracts; ARM linking establishes ABI, selected closure and static budgets. Power consumption, wake edges, IRQ latency and physical retention still require independent HIL, currently `not_executed`."
